          "eyebrow": "Retail Partnerships",
          "headline": "Interested in stocking Forma Intime?",
          "subheadline": "We partner with a small number of specialist retailers each year. If your store shares our commitment to anatomical fit and material transparency, we'd like to hear from you.",
