        },
        {
          "id": "stockists-section-4",
          "nl_prompt": "**Section 4 — Contact Block (Retail Partnerships)**

Layout: Full-width Forma Nude (#EDE0D4) background band — the warmest, most human surface on the page, reserved for this closing moment. The Forma Nude background bridges the clinical precision of the stockist data with the brand's body-positive warmth, exactly as the design system specifies for this color token. Section vertical padding: 80px top, 80px bottom — generous, deliberate breathing room that signals 'end of document, take your time.'

Content is a single contained panel, max-width 640px, left-aligned within the content grid (starting at column 1, not centered). This asymmetric placement maintains the page's left-dominant text rhythm and avoids the centered-CTA-block template pattern.

Content stack:
- Eyebrow: IBM Plex Mono, uppercase, 11px, 0.14em letter-spacing, Rigor Teal (#3A8C7E). Text: 'RETAIL PARTNERSHIPS'. 24px bottom margin.
- Headline: DM Sans SemiBold, 36px, -0.02em tracking, Calibration Ink (#1C2B35), sentence case. 'Interested in stocking Forma Intime?' 16px bottom margin.
- Subheadline: IBM Plex Sans Regular, 18px, 1.7 line-height, Precision Slate (#3D4F5C). 'We partner with a small number of specialist retailers each year. If your store shares our commitment to anatomical fit and material transparency, we'd like to hear from you.' Max-width 580px. 20px bottom margin.
- Body: IBM Plex Sans Regular, 16px, 1.7 line-height, Precision Slate (#3D4F5C) at 80% opacity. 'Wholesale and stockist partnership enquiries: trade@formaintime.com. We respond to all qualified enquiries within five business days.' The email address 'trade@formaintime.com' is rendered in IBM Plex Mono at 14px, Rigor Teal (#3A8C7E), as an inline mailto link — the monospaced register signals a precise, documented contact point. 32px bottom margin after body.
- CTA button: 'Send a Partnership Enquiry'. Rigor Teal (#3A8C7E) filled background, Forma White (#F7F8F9) DM Sans SemiBold text at 16px. Padding: 14px top/bottom, 28px left/right. Border-radius: 4px — squared enough to feel clinical, not pill-shaped. No icon. Left-aligned with the text stack (not centered). On hover: background deepens ~10% toward Calibration Ink, button lifts 2px (translateY -2px), transition ~180ms. On keyboard focus: 2px Rigor Teal outline with 3px offset.

No decorative elements, no imagery, no background pattern. The Forma Nude surface does all the tonal work. The sparseness of this section is the design decision — after two dense data-card grids, this restraint is earned.

On the right side of the section (columns 8–12 on desktop), there is deliberate empty space — no content, no filler. This negative space is structural, not accidental: it signals that the brand is selective and unhurried, consistent with the voice ('We partner with a small number of specialist retailers each year').

Scroll-triggered reveal: The entire panel (eyebrow through CTA) fades in and scales very subtly from 98% to 100% as the section enters the viewport — a single composed entrance, no stagger, no slide. This is the quietest reveal on the page, matching the section's restrained register. Wired with IntersectionObserver.

On mobile: the panel spans full width. The CTA button spans full width on mobile only. The email address wraps gracefully within its IBM Plex Mono style. Vertical padding reduces to 56px top/bottom."
